### Ignore inactive retained mappings in modifier-conflict validation

**Severity:** `high`

The modifier-conflict scan has the same active-profile mismatch. An inactive generic or sided modifier row retained in metadata can block an otherwise valid edit in the current profile even though it is not present in the candidate engine configuration.

